        // Random — migrated post-v0.7.5: PCG step + entropy source
        // moved into a top-level @c { } block inside src/stdlib/random.am.
        // The runtime header is gone; the public API (NextUInt32,
        // IntRange, Float, Bool, Bytes…) is pure AM bridging to the
        // four @c helpers via tiny calls.
        // DateTime — migrated post-v0.7.5 to pure Amalgame in
